ARTIFACTS:

Named weapons (artifacts) are given to you by your god for sacrifices at 
altars.  Rarely are they found in shops, and very rarely in the dungeons.  
Other ways of getting named weapons include polymorphing a pile of useless 
weapons until you get a named one or wishing for one.  Excalibur can be
obtained by dipping a longsword in a fountain until it is named or by
praying (if your god crowns you the hand of Elbereth).  Sting and Orcrist
can be obtained by naming the appropriate weapons.  The special features 
are only a few things that I have been able to work out.  There are bound to 
be more features for each weapon which I have not been able to work out.  The 
Alignment is, I think, used for the chances of getting the weapon from your 
god.  I.E. If you're Neutral you'll only get those weapons, and not stuff like 
