Other Ideas:(taken verbatim from another source)
      The first thing that I do is to zap it when a monster is around.  If it
is non-directional you will usually find out what it is immediately. A non-
directional wand that doesn't seen to do anything is a wand of secret door
detection.  If it asks for a direction, zap it at a monster so that it will 
not bounce back at you.  This should tell you what it is.  If that does not
help, engrave with it.  There are only four kinds left after this: locking,
opening, undead turning, and nothing.  The first two can be done at any door.
Then try it on an undead monster.  If nothing happens, it is nothing.
Note: Be near a staircase because a wand of polymorph on an animal may
create an unwanted dragon.
